    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady are delighted to present this stunning 3 bedroom semi-detached property to the market. The property itself is immaculately presented and is bright and spacious throughout extending to C. 87 sq.m. Accommodation consists of entrance hall, living-room, kitchen/dining-room, downstairs w.c., sitting room, 3 bedrooms (main en-suite) and family bathroom. The property is located in the Termon Abbey development just off the Termonfeckin Road on the North side of Drogheda it is an ideal first time home, boasting a wonderful location close to a range of amenities including schools, sporting facilities, shops, and Drogheda town centre is a short distance away. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
